---
title: Garlicky Spicy Vodka Ramen
servings: 2
prep-time: 5 minutes
cook-time: 15 minutes
tags: [ramen, spicy, quick-recipes, noodles, creamy]
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQ_-cQkiOLX/
image: https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/574752715_18544332571001116_900199950575928512_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=_MY3TvEL7SIQ7kNvwGHXRkl&_nc_oc=AdlwUEe3-9tx7U0zAVK7A7FIDZ_AoKuzewOdumTBXAHO9Y4azSapFKdmk8jRg0uiQFY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=leKQyXgHDqHpqbf2M5Oupg&oh=00_AfmFi2paP8C6afLkyI8glh-bKdNEaTIc_zouGji_cmlVGA&oe=69512FFA
---

Bring a large pot of water to a boil and season with @salt{0.5%tsp}. Add @ramen noodles{2%packets} and cook until just tender, about ~{3%minutes}. Drain and set aside.

In a large skillet, heat @olive oil{1%tbsp} over medium heat. Add @garlic{3%cloves} and @crushed red pepper{0.5%tsp} and sauté until fragrant, about ~{1%minutes}. Deglaze with @vodka{2%tbsp} and simmer until reduced by half, ~{2%minutes}. Stir in @heavy cream{0.75%cups} and simmer until thickened, ~{2%minutes}. Season with @salt{0.5%tsp} and @black pepper{0.25%tsp}. If using, stir in @parmesan cheese{0.25%cup}.

Add @ramen noodles{2%packets} to the sauce and toss to coat, heating through for ~{1%minutes}. Divide between bowls and serve.